title: NM_Ending
---
Mom: ...
Mom: I'm so thankful you came to visit.
Mom: When I was younger, I never saw my mom.
Mom: She lived in the city and I lived with my sisters in the countryside.
Mom: She visited as much as she could, but...
Mom: She had to work to support us.
Mom: When I had you, I promised I'd give you the best life I could.
Mom: I love you.
	->I love you.
		<<LoadLevel GameManager game_over>>
	->I miss you.
		<<LoadLevel GameManager game_over>>
